cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Hansard Dewan Rakyat as searchable text"
message: "If you use this text, cite the official Hansard of the Dewan Rakyat, and you can also cite this dataset."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "hansard-dewan-rakyat contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jqquah/hansard-dewan-rakyat"
url: "https://github.com/jqquah/hansard-dewan-rakyat"
abstract: >-
  The Hansard (official record of debates) of the Dewan Rakyat, Parliament of Malaysia,
  from 1959 to now, converted from the official PDFs to Markdown text with speaker markers,
  page markers and source checksums.
keywords:
  - Hansard
  - Malaysia
  - Parliament
  - Dewan Rakyat
  - parliamentary debates
license: MIT
